# AMMOcoin release-signing public keys (OpenSSH allowed_signers format).
#
# Each non-comment line is:
#   <identity> [options] <key-type> <key-data> [comment]
#
# This file pins the public keys whose detached signatures are trusted to
# certify AMMOcoin release artifacts (CHECKSUMS files, etc.). Anyone with
# write access to this file can effectively replace the project's release
# signer — protect it accordingly and review changes in PR.
#
# To add a key:
#   1. The release maintainer generates an Ed25519 key dedicated to releases:
#        ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/ammocoin_release_ed25519 \
#          -C "release@ammocoin.org"
#   2. Append the *public* key (cat ~/.ssh/ammocoin_release_ed25519.pub) to
#      this file, prefixed with the identity:
#        release@ammocoin.org ssh-ed25519 AAAA... release@ammocoin.org
#   3. Commit, sign the commit, and publish.
#
# Verifiers run `scripts/release/verify-release.sh <file>` against an
# artifact + its `.sig`. The verifier hard-fails if this file is empty.
#
# --- TRUSTED KEYS BELOW THIS LINE ---
